氏，元帝宮人也。初有寵，生明帝及琅邪王裒，由是為虞后所忌。自以位卑，每懷怨望，為帝所譴，漸見疏薄。及明帝即位，封建安君，別立第宅。太寧元年，帝迎還臺內，供奉隆厚。及成帝立，尊重同于太后。咸康元年薨。詔曰：「朕少遭憫凶，慈訓無稟，撫育之勤，建安君之仁也。一旦薨殂，實思報復，永惟平昔，感痛哀摧。其贈豫章郡君，別立廟于京都。」","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-032-zheng-achun-family:xun-lady-care:p001:m0107","object_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-032-zheng-achun-family:xun-lady-care:p001:m0123"}],"interpretation_note":"成帝詔朕回憶撫育者建安君；這是照育，不把荀氏改成成帝生母或法定養母。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"name_components":[{"person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAAAAAA","title":"成帝","surname":"司馬","ming":"衍","additional_names":[],"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-007","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-007-chengdi-family","source_id":"s-jinshu-007-chengdi-family","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-007-chengdi-family:p001","quote":"成皇帝諱衍，字世根，明帝長子也。","status":"editorial_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"model":null,"note":"衍、世根及明帝長子據傳首；司馬為晉帝室編輯分姓，不冒稱原句書全名。","zi":"世根"}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-007-chengdi-family:p001:m0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"成皇帝","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-007-chengdi-family:p001","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-007-chengdi-family"},{"id":"c-jinshu-007-chengdi-family:p001:m0004","start":4,"end":5,"surface":"衍","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-007-chengdi-family:p001","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-007-chengdi-family"},{"id":"c-jinshu-007-chengdi-family:p001:m0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"世根","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-007-chengdi-family:p001","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-007-chengdi-family"},{"id":"c-jinshu-032-zheng-achun-family:xun-lady-care:p001:m0086","start":86,"end":88,"surface":"成帝","kind":"person","pers